{"unit_id":"rh666666__dsh-plugin-debug-mode#feature-1","repo":"rh666666/dsh-plugin-debug-mode","commit":"39ae4feba7bfa39f818a78e68445de6f2b16573d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-plugin-debug-mode** 的功能「使用 `/debug` 启动调试」：用户输入现象后由命令签发会话票据，并把原始描述投递给 Agent；调试准则通过系统提示注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/command.js:27","lib/command.js:42","lib/command.js:61"]}
