{"unit_id":"rh666666__dsh-plugin-debug-mode#caveat-1","repo":"rh666666/dsh-plugin-debug-mode","commit":"39ae4feba7bfa39f818a78e68445de6f2b16573d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-plugin-debug-mode** 使用前须知：任务日志默认写入系统临时目录；不可写时改存工作区 `.dsh/debug-mode/`，并提示用户。（见 lib/debug-service.js:194-209）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/debug-service.js:194"]}
{"unit_id":"rh666666__dsh-plugin-debug-mode#caveat-2","repo":"rh666666/dsh-plugin-debug-mode","commit":"39ae4feba7bfa39f818a78e68445de6f2b16573d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-plugin-debug-mode** 使用前须知：浏览器探针和面板经 DSH Web 服务通信；地址取自 `DSH_WEB_URL` 或服务端口。（见 lib/debug-service.js:715-736）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/debug-service.js:715"]}
